#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:2
msgid "AWS |enterprise-only|"
msgstr "AWS |enterprise-only|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:7
msgid "Public cloud integrations including AWS are Enterprise-only features."
msgstr "Integrações de nuvem pública incluindo AWS são recursos apenas Enterprise."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:12
msgid ""
"AWS is the Amazon public cloud, offering a full range of services and "
"features across the globe in various datacenters. AWS provides businesses"
" with a flexible, highly scalable, and low-cost way to deliver a variety "
"of services using open standard technologies as well as proprietary "
"solutions. This section of documentation will help you get |morpheus| and"
" AWS connected to utilize the features below:"
msgstr "A AWS é a nuvem pública da Amazon, oferecendo uma gama completa de serviços e recursos ao redor do globo em vários datacenters. O |morpheus| integra-se à AWS para provisionamento, sincronização, costing e gerenciamento do ciclo de vida."

