#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:319
msgid ""
"If the Cost Explorer permissions are granted at the master account level,"
" the user will see all costs for each member account; if granted at the "
"member account, only the costs for that member account are available."
msgstr "Se as permissões do Cost Explorer forem concedidas no nível da conta master, o usuário verá todos os custos de cada conta membro. Se concedidas no nível da conta membro, apenas os custos dessa conta serão visíveis."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:321
msgid ""
"With the AWS console configuration steps complete, we can move back into "
"|morpheus|. Keep in mind it is only necessary to set up one AWS cloud for"
" Costing since we process all records in the CUR report."
msgstr "Com as etapas de configuração do console AWS concluídas, podemos voltar ao |morpheus|. Tenha em mente que só é necessário criar o CUR uma vez por conta de faturamento."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:323
msgid ""
"Once back in |morpheus|, add or edit the relevant AWS cloud integration "
"(Infrastructure > Clouds > :guilabel:`+ ADD` OR click the pencil icon in "
"the row for the chosen AWS integration). Expand the Advanced Options "
"drawer and complete the following fields:"
msgstr "De volta ao |morpheus|, adicione ou edite a integração de nuvem AWS relevante (Infrastructure > Clouds > :guilabel:`+ ADD` OU selecione a Nuvem e clique em :guilabel:`EDIT`)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:335
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/7morphConfig.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:337
msgid "Save changes to your cloud integration."
msgstr "Salve as alterações na sua integração de nuvem."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:339
msgid ""
"It may take as long as one hour for |morpheus| to process the next CUR "
"report."
msgstr "Pode levar até uma hora para que o |morpheus| processe o próximo relatório CUR."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:342
msgid "Global (Costing Aggregator Only) (v5.5.1+)"
msgstr "Global (Apenas Costing Aggregator) (v5.5.1+)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:344
msgid ""
"Costing can be created for specific clouds individually, following the "
"steps previously mentioned.  If the same account is added multiple times,"
" using different regions, the same CUR file is available to be selected "
"(if the configured user has access).  However, this can become a tedious "
"process in needing to configure the CUR on each cloud added to "
"|morpheus|.  However, |morpheus| has a region of `Global (Costing "
"Aggregator Only)`, which can be chosen at the time of adding a cloud.  "
"This region is not designed for deploying workloads, it is here primarily"
" for syncing costs.  This means that the AWS account added as a cloud in "
"|morpheus| as a Global region can sync the cost for all the other regions"
" of the same account added as clouds into |morpheus|."
msgstr "O costing pode ser criado para nuvens específicas individualmente, seguindo as etapas mencionadas anteriormente. Se a mesma conta for adicionada várias vezes (diferentes regiões), o costing pode ser configurado apenas em uma e usado como agregador."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:348
msgid ""
"When using AWS Organizations, if the AWS account added as a global region"
" is the management account (formerly known as master account) and "
"consolidated billing is enabled, costs for **all** accounts can be sync'd"
" using the Global region.  This means when any AWS and/or regions in the "
"organization are added as clouds in |morpheus|, the appropriate costs are"
" applied to them automatically.  It does require that **Costing** is "
"enabled on the cloud to see the costs but a Costing Report does not need "
"to be chosen. This enables the use of one cloud added as Global to sync "
"all costs and apply to all AWS clouds added in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Ao usar AWS Organizations, se a conta AWS adicionada como região global for a management account (anteriormente conhecida como master account), o costing de todas as contas membro pode ser agregado."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:352
msgid ""
"Additionally, some costs in AWS are not region specific, for example the "
"`Global` and `No Region` regions.  These costs do not apply to the "
"regions of the clouds added in |morpheus|.  With the Global region added "
"as a cloud in |morpheus|, you would be able to see these costs that are "
"applicable to your accounts."
msgstr "Além disso, alguns custos na AWS não são específicos de região, por exemplo as regiões `Global` e `No Region`. Esses custos serão capturados quando o costing global estiver configurado."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:356
msgid "Costing and AWS GovCloud"
msgstr "Costing e AWS GovCloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:358
msgid ""
"AWS GovCloud delivers Amazon public cloud infrastructure and features in "
"a way that complies with U.S. government standards for security. GovCloud"
" accounts are applied for and must be associated with a pre-existing "
"standard AWS account and the usage and billing data for the GovCloud "
"account is rolled up into that of the standard AWS account. For that "
"reason, Amazon recommends creating a new standard account solely to house"
" the GovCloud account if usage and billing must be tracked separately."
msgstr "A AWS GovCloud entrega infraestrutura e recursos de nuvem pública Amazon de uma forma que cumpre os padrões do governo dos EUA."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:360
msgid ""
"Since GovCloud accounts do not have access to billing data directly, "
"|morpheus| must be able to access it through the associated standard "
"account. You could do this by creating the |morpheus| cloud integration "
"through the standard account itself or by integrating the GovCloud "
"account and supplying an Access Key and Secret Key for the standard "
"account when configuring costing. When needed, add the additional "
"credentials for the standard commercial account as described below:"
msgstr "Como as contas GovCloud não têm acesso aos dados de faturamento diretamente, o |morpheus| deve poder acessá-los por meio da conta comercial padrão associada."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:362
msgid "Add a new AWS Cloud or edit an existing one"
msgstr "Adicione uma nova Nuvem AWS ou edite uma existente"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:363
msgid "Expand the Advanced Options section"
msgstr "Expanda a seção Advanced Options"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:364
msgid ""
"Complete the following fields in addition to other required fields needed"
" to set up costing as described in the previous section:"
msgstr "Preencha os seguintes campos além de outros campos obrigatórios necessários para configurar o costing conforme descrito na seção anterior"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:366
msgid ""
"**COSTING KEY:** The AWS Key ID for an IAM user with sufficient access "
"who is associated with the standard commercial account"
msgstr "**COSTING KEY:** O AWS Key ID para um usuário IAM com acesso suficiente associado à conta comercial padrão"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:367
msgid ""
"**COSTING SECRET:** The AWS Secret Key for an IAM user with sufficient "
"access who is associated with the standard commercial account"
msgstr "**COSTING SECRET:** O AWS Secret Key para um usuário IAM com acesso suficiente associado à conta comercial padrão"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:368
msgid ""
"**LINKED ACCOUNT ID:** The AWS account number for the standard commercial"
" account in which the IAM user referenced in the prior bullets resides"
msgstr "**LINKED ACCOUNT ID:** O número da conta AWS da conta comercial padrão na qual o usuário IAM referenciado nos campos anteriores reside"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:370
msgid "Save the changes to the AWS Cloud integration"
msgstr "Salve as alterações na integração da Nuvem AWS"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:372
msgid ""
"When credentials are configured correctly, you will be able to select an "
"existing Costing and Usage Report (CUR) from the appropriate S3 bucket if"
" it already exists. If not, you can create one directly from the add/edit"
" AWS Cloud modal in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Quando as credenciais estiverem configuradas corretamente, você poderá selecionar um Costing and Usage Report (CUR) existente no dropdown"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:374
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/8govcloudCosting.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:378
msgid "AWS Reserved Instances and Savings Plans"
msgstr "AWS Reserved Instances e Savings Plans"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:380
msgid ""
"Amazon AWS public cloud offers Reserved Instances (RI) and Savings Plans,"
" which allow organizations with consistent use patterns to reduce cloud "
"spend significantly. |morpheus| analyzes AWS cloud usage and spend, which"
" allows it to make intelligent recommendations that can lead to "
"significant savings. This data can be reviewed in the Reservation "
"Recommendations and Savings Plan Recommendations tables on any AWS Cloud "
"detail page (Infrastructure > Clouds > Selected Amazon Cloud)."
msgstr "A nuvem pública Amazon AWS oferece Reserved Instances (RI) e Savings Plans, que permitem que organizações com padrões de uso consistentes reduzam significativamente os gastos com nuvem. O |morpheus| analisa o uso e os gastos da nuvem AWS, o que lhe permite fazer recomendações inteligentes que podem levar a economias significativas. Esses dados podem ser revisados nas tabelas Reservation Recommendations e Savings Plan Recommendations em qualquer página de detalhes de Nuvem AWS (Infrastructure > Clouds > Amazon Cloud Selecionada)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:382
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Savings Plans potentially offer greater than 70% savings in exchange for "
"a commitment to consistent usage levels for a 1- or 3-year term. "
"|morpheus| provides Savings Plan guidance based on learned analytics; "
"allowing you to analyze Savings Plans based on different term commitments"
" and upfront costs to choose the best savings plan."
msgstr "Savings Plans oferecem potencialmente mais de 70% savings em troca de um compromisso com níveis de uso consistentes por um período de 1 ou 3 anos. O |morpheus| fornece orientação de Savings Plan com base em análises aprendidas, permitindo analisar Savings Plans segundo diferentes compromissos de prazo e custos iniciais para escolher o melhor plano de economia."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:384
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/aws/savingsPlan.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:386
msgid ""
"Reserved Instances (RI) provide a discounted hourly rate and optional "
"capacity reservation for EC2 instances. AWS billing automatically applies"
" your RI-discounted rate when the attributes of EC2 instance usage match "
"attributes of an active RI. |morpheus| provides RI guidance based on "
"learned analytics."
msgstr "Reserved Instances (RI) fornecem uma taxa horária com desconto e reserva de capacidade opcional para instâncias EC2. O faturamento AWS aplica automaticamente sua taxa com desconto RI quando os atributos de uso da instância EC2 correspondem aos atributos de uma RI ativa. O |morpheus| fornece orientação de RI com base em análises aprendidas."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:388
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/aws/ri.png"
msgstr ""

